            "text": "Press Start exercise below to start the mic and the band, which switches between Am7 and D7. On \"oo\", sing {{5}} over Am7 and step up to {{6}} over D7. Then try {{b7}} over Am7 and step down to {{6}} over D7.\nTap {{6}} on the staff to hear it: it is the note to aim for in the next block."
